<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan 28-day T-bill yield flat, 91-day slips.</title>
<headline>Moldovan 28-day T-bill yield flat, 91-day slips.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills was unchanged at 22.54 percent, compared to the previous auction a week ago, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 27.88 percent from 30.19</p>
<p>percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Oct 22	  Oct 15</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   6.00 million lei  6.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 6.87 million	10.55 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    6.00 million	6.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    22.54 pct     22.54 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    98.3 pct	98.3 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  98.1-99.0 pct 97.7-98.6 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 Nov 21, 1996  Nov 14, 1996</p>
